<%= @user.email_address %> just signed up as "<%= @account.name %>".

The account is already approved and has a "Production" source waiting on its Setup page. Nothing to do unless it looks like abuse. View account:

<%= @account_url %>

Suspending from that page hides the app behind a "paused" notice and makes the account's webhooks return 404 right away; you can restore it from the same page. This link works for 30 days; after that, use the console.
